    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The Atlassian Admin API provides programmatic access to manage Atlassian organizations, users, domains, policies, and events. It enables administrators to automate organization management tasks, integrate with identity providers, and ensure appropriate access to Atlassian products.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Atlassian Developer",
